-- deck-icons.lua (deck) — the shared offline icon registry (plan §5.4).
--
-- A single `name -> inner-svg` table plus an `icon_svg(name)` helper, loaded by
-- BOTH deck-shortcodes.lua (the `{{< icon >}}` / `{{< stat >}}` shortcodes) and
-- deck-layout.lua (the `:::{.card .stat icon=…}` Div path). The table used to
-- live inside deck-shortcodes.lua; lifting it here lets the div-path stat draw
-- the SAME glyph the shortcode does — closing PL-1 with no duplicated paths and
-- no extra filter pass.
--
-- Paths are lifted verbatim from Bootstrap Icons (MIT) via the installed
-- `bsicons` package (viewBox 0 0 16 16). Every glyph is drawn with
-- `fill="currentColor"` so context (a teal chip, a coral stat) tints it.
-- Reads ONLY a baked-in table: no network, no external deps.

